            "    Saving      1150.25 4.57e-249 ***\n",
            "\n",
            "  * p<0.05  ** p<0.01  *** p<0.001  ns = not significant\n",
            "\n",
            "=================================================================\n",
            "  CHI-SQUARE TEST (H₀: variable is independent of cluster)\n",
            "=================================================================\n",
            "   Variable    Chi²  dof   p-value Sig\n",
            "     Gender 1045.83    3 2.06e-226 ***\n",
            "        Job 2731.02   12  0.00e+00 ***\n",
            "       Area  148.18    6  1.88e-29 ***\n",
            "Investments 1617.77    6  0.00e+00 ***\n",
            "   CitySize 3013.00    6  0.00e+00 ***\n",
