        "\n",
        "| Segment | Action |\n",
        "|---------|--------|\n",
        "| Mass Passive (C0) | Financial education campaigns, entry-level PAC onboarding |\n",
        "| Mass Active (C1) | PAC upgrade, cross-selling (insurance, funds), digital loyalty |\n",
        "| Elderly Conservatives (C2) | Capital protection products, physical advisory, ESG offerings |\n",
        "| Young Affluent Investors (C3) | Active wealth management, ESG portfolios, premium digital channels |"
