      "source": [
        "### Recommended Actions — Rationale\n",
        "\n",
        "**C0 — Mass Passive:** the barrier is not financial capacity (income ~0.55, identical\n",
        "to C1) but behavioral inertia. The right lever is financial education and low-friction\n",
        "PAC onboarding to convert passive clients into active investors.\n",
        "\n",
        "**C1 — Mass Active:** already investing via PAC, already digital. The priority shifts\n",
        "from acquisition to retention and upgrade — cross-selling complementary products\n",
        "before a digital competitor does.\n",
        "\n",
        "**C2 — Elderly Conservatives:** near-zero debt, low digital propensity, no long-term\n",
        "investment horizon. The goal is capital preservation, not growth. Physical advisory\n",
        "is the required channel. High ESG score suggests values-based products may resonate.\n",
        "\n",
        "**C3 — Young Affluent Investors:** highest income, FinEdu, and Digital scores.\n",
        "The most profitable and most contested segment. Active wealth management and\n",
        "premium digital channels are both justified and expected by this client profile."
      ]
